  "_README": [
    "HAND-MAINTAINED, like club_merges.json and club_names.json. Not generated:",
    "nothing can derive 'Spurs' from 'Tottenham Hotspur'.",
    "",
    "What a club is actually CALLED by the people searching for it. The hub's",
    "search folds accents and matches substrings, which already covers 'malaga'",
    "-> 'Málaga' and 'man' -> 'Manchester United'. It cannot cover a name that",
    "shares no letters with the official one, which is most of how football",
    "clubs are really referred to.",
    "",
    "Deliberately a maintained list rather than fuzzy matching. Fuzzy scoring",
    "sends 'Reading' to 'Real Madrid' and is impossible to correct when it does;",
    "a wrong line here is one line to fix. Add aliases freely, but never one",
    "that could reasonably mean a DIFFERENT club: 'United' and 'City' are not",
    "here on purpose.",
    "",
    "Keys are team slugs and must exist in slugs.json. Values are lowercase and",
    "unaccented — the search folds the query the same way before comparing."
